Journey: Upload and download files
Tags: @the-internet @files
Base URL: https://the-internet.herokuapp.com

Open /upload
Upload "journeys/data/upload-me.txt" to #file-upload
Click the "Upload" button
  Expect the page contains "File Uploaded!"
  Expect #uploaded-files contains "upload-me.txt"

Open /download
Capture the text of the 1st link inside #content as firstFile
Download the 1st link inside #content as firstDownload
  Expect the download firstDownload exists
Expect the download firstDownload is named "${firstFile}"
